{"seq":2,"slug":"spatial-alignment-deconvolution","title":"空间配准与去卷积细胞类型映射机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/spatial-transcriptomics-platform-analysis/spatial-alignment-deconvolution","wordCount":2551,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"空间配准与去卷积细胞类型映射机制\">空间配准与去卷积细胞类型映射机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么空间数据天然-错位\">核心概念：为什么空间数据天然「错位」</h2><p>空间转录组拿到的东西，本质上是两类坐标系的叠加：一张<strong>形态学图像</strong>（H&amp;E、DAPI、免疫荧光）和一个<strong>分子测量坐标</strong>（Visium 的 55 µm 斑点网格、Xenium/MERFISH 的亚细胞转录本点）。这两套坐标从来不是天生对齐的——切片在载玻片上会拉伸、旋转、折叠，成像与测序捕获区之间存在微小但非线性的形变，同一块组织的连续切片之间更是各有各的扭曲。与此同时，每个测量单元的<strong>成分</strong>也是未知的：一个 55 µm Visium 斑点里可能压着 1–10 个细胞，测到的是它们的混合表达谱，而不是任何单一细胞的谱。</p>\n<p>这两件事对应两个正交的工程问题：<strong>配准（registration / alignment）</strong> 解决「空间位置对不对得上」，<strong>去卷积（deconvolution）</strong> 解决「每个位置的表达是哪些细胞贡献的」。它们常被混为一谈，但一个错位的坐标会让再精确的去卷积也落到错误的位置上。本文拆解这两条链路的机制、代表工具与验证方式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[组织切片] --&gt; B[形态学图像&lt;br/&gt;H&amp;E / DAPI / IF]&#10;    A --&gt; C[分子测量&lt;br/&gt;spot 网格 或 转录本点]&#10;    B --&gt; D{配准}&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[刚性/仿射对齐&lt;br/&gt;旋转 平移 缩放]&#10;    E --&gt; F[非刚性形变&lt;br/&gt;薄板样条 / 光流 / 最优传输]&#10;    F --&gt; G[统一坐标下的&lt;br/&gt;图像 x 表达]&#10;    G --&gt; H[去卷积]&#10;    H --&gt; I[参考单细胞图谱&lt;br/&gt;scRNA-seq 签名矩阵]&#10;    I --&gt; J[每位置细胞类型比例&lt;br/&gt;+ 空间细胞图谱]\">flowchart TD\n    A[组织切片] --&gt; B[形态学图像&lt;br/&gt;H&amp;E / DAPI / IF]\n    A --&gt; C[分子测量&lt;br/&gt;spot 网格 或 转录本点]\n    B --&gt; D{配准}\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[刚性/仿射对齐&lt;br/&gt;旋转 平移 缩放]\n    E --&gt; F[非刚性形变&lt;br/&gt;薄板样条 / 光流 / 最优传输]\n    F --&gt; G[统一坐标下的&lt;br/&gt;图像 x 表达]\n    G --&gt; H[去卷积]\n    H --&gt; I[参考单细胞图谱&lt;br/&gt;scRNA-seq 签名矩阵]\n    I --&gt; J[每位置细胞类型比例&lt;br/&gt;+ 空间细胞图谱]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n<th>代表工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图像配准</td>\n<td>两套坐标 + 图像</td>\n<td>形变场 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>斑点落到错误组织结构</td>\n<td>STalign、PASTE、SpatialLIBD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨切片对齐</td>\n<td>多张连续切片</td>\n<td>共享坐标系</td>\n<td>伪 3D 重建错层</td>\n<td>PASTE、STAligner</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去卷积</td>\n<td>spot 表达 + 单细胞参考</td>\n<td>细胞类型比例</td>\n<td>比例失真、类型串号</td>\n<td>cell2location、RCTD、SPOTlight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>映射</td>\n<td>单细胞 + 空间点</td>\n<td>细胞级位置</td>\n<td>细胞定位错配</td>\n<td>Tangram、CytoSpace</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"图像配准-从关键点到最优传输\">图像配准：从关键点到最优传输</h2><p>配准的第一层是<strong>刚性/仿射变换</strong>：用一组标志点（landmark，如组织轮廓角点、血管分叉、解剖结构边缘）估计旋转、平移、缩放与剪切，把两套坐标粗对齐。这一步足以处理「切片整体摆放不同」这种最常见的错位，用最小二乘即可求解变换矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A, \\mathbf{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">t</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">t</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{A,\\mathbf{t}} \\sum_{k} \\lVert A\\,x_k + \\mathbf{t} - y_k \\rVert^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathbf mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7183em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 对标志点在源坐标与目标坐标中的位置。</p>\n<p>但当组织发生<strong>局部非线性形变</strong>（切片过程中的褶皱、局部拉伸），仿射就不够了，需要非刚性方法。STalign（<em>Nature Communications</em> 2023）用 LDDMM（大形变微分同胚度量映射）把形变建模为一个随时间演化的速度场，求解得到的变换保证可逆、不产生自交折叠——这对组织学切片特别重要，因为薄层组织容易在拉伸中撕裂。另一种思路来自<strong>最优传输</strong>：PASTE（<em>Nature Methods</em>，Zeira 等）把「对齐两张切片」写成<strong>融合 Gromov–Wasserstein</strong> 问题，同时考虑空间距离与表达相似度，因此能在没有共同图像、只有表达矩阵的场景下对齐连续切片。它的代价函数同时惩罚「空间上该近的被拉远」和「表达像的被推远」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>π</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>α</mi><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{\\pi} \\; (1-\\alpha)\\sum_{i,j} \\lVert x_i - x_j \\rVert^2 \\pi_{ij} \\;+\\; \\alpha \\sum_{i,k} \\lVert e_i - e_k \\rVert^2 \\pi_{ik}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.45em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1502em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 是传输计划（一个双随机矩阵），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 是空间坐标，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 是表达向量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 平衡空间与表达两路信息。这个设计的意义在于：<strong>配准不再依赖像素强度，而能直接吃分子数据</strong>，让没有高质量 H&amp;E 的样本也能对齐。</p>\n<p>工程上要注意的是形变自由度的取舍。给一个人为的高自由度薄板样条（TPS）几乎总能把指标刷漂亮，但它可能把斑点拉到解剖学上不可能的位置。稳健做法是：先仿射粗对齐 → 用少量可信标志点做 TPS 精修 → 用<strong>独立标志点</strong>（配准时没用到的那批结构）评估残差，而不是只看优化目标下降。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去卷积-把斑点拆成细胞类型比例\">去卷积：把斑点拆成细胞类型比例</h2><p>去卷积的核心假设很朴素：<strong>一个 spot 的表达 = 该 spot 内各细胞类型表达谱的加权和</strong>。设 spot <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的基因表达向量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，细胞类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的参考签名矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（来自 scRNA-seq 图谱），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≈</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>C</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_s \\;\\approx\\; \\sum_{c=1}^{C} w_{s,c}\\, W_c, \\qquad w_{s,c} \\ge 0, \\quad \\sum_c 